1
00:00:00,060 --> 00:00:03,946
In this town, everyone has a battery bar floating over their head.

2
00:00:05,260 --> 00:00:07,025
When it's full, you're happy.

3
00:00:07,593 --> 00:00:10,571
When it's empty, you fall asleep wherever you are.

4
00:00:11,560 --> 00:00:13,628
In the middle of the street.

5
00:00:14,293 --> 00:00:16,362
In the middle of a sentence.

6
00:00:17,027 --> 00:00:19,701
Everyone charges at night, in giant charging stations.

7
00:00:20,593 --> 00:00:23,571
Plug in. Sleep. Wake up at one hundred percent.

8
00:00:24,560 --> 00:00:25,719
Everyone except you.

9
00:00:26,360 --> 00:00:28,125
Your battery has never moved.

10
00:00:28,693 --> 00:00:31,671
It's been stuck at one percent your whole life.

11
00:00:32,660 --> 00:00:34,122
Doctors can't explain it.

12
00:00:34,593 --> 00:00:37,268
The charging station won't even let you in.

13
00:00:38,160 --> 00:00:39,622
"Error. Battery not found."

14
00:00:40,093 --> 00:00:41,858
So you just... stay awake.

15
00:00:42,427 --> 00:00:46,313
You're the only one who has ever seen the town at night.

16
00:00:47,627 --> 00:00:48,483
Empty streets.

17
00:00:49,427 --> 00:00:50,586
Every house dark.

18
00:00:51,227 --> 00:00:52,689
Every person plugged in.

19
00:00:53,160 --> 00:00:56,137
But last night, the charging station made a sound.

20
00:00:57,127 --> 00:00:59,195
Something it has never done before.

21
00:00:59,860 --> 00:01:00,716
A voice.

22
00:01:01,660 --> 00:01:03,122
"Charging complete. Begin harvest."

23
00:01:03,593 --> 00:01:05,965
All the batteries in town started draining.

24
00:01:06,760 --> 00:01:08,547
One hundred percent. Seventy. Forty.

25
00:01:09,093 --> 00:01:10,555
Not into the people.

26
00:01:11,027 --> 00:01:12,186
Out of them.

27
00:01:12,827 --> 00:01:13,986
Into the station.

28
00:01:14,627 --> 00:01:16,998
You ran to your mom's charging pod.

29
00:01:17,793 --> 00:01:19,862
Her battery was at twelve percent.

30
00:01:20,527 --> 00:01:21,989
You pulled her plug.

31
00:01:22,460 --> 00:01:23,949
Alarms went off everywhere.

32
00:01:24,393 --> 00:01:27,068
And every head in town turned toward you.

33
00:01:27,960 --> 00:01:29,119
Their eyes opened.

34
00:01:29,760 --> 00:01:31,525
All at the same time.

35
00:01:32,093 --> 00:01:33,858
"Battery not found," they said.

36
00:01:34,427 --> 00:01:35,586
"Battery not found."

37
00:01:36,227 --> 00:01:37,689
That's when you realized.

38
00:01:38,160 --> 00:01:39,622
Your battery isn't broken.

39
00:01:40,093 --> 00:01:42,465
It's the only one they can't eat.

